Package: com.infernowolf19.switchertrace
Name: SwitcherTrace
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Diagnostic only. Records how SpringBoard's app switcher opens and closes (iPadOS 16.0, build 20A8372) so a missing close animation can be traced. Does nothing unless a debug file exists.
Maintainer: infernowolf19
Author: infernowolf19
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
